# The six structures at their anchors, one struck A3 each (string, marimba, bar, membrane, bell, glass), then the
# same notes half-way between neighbours. P2 150 (6 s ring), release 70 so each rings into the next.
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 2.0
track lead
preset 0 150 0 0 255 70 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 A3 2 110
param p1 51 4
note 4 A3 2 110
param p1 102 8
note 8 A3 2 110
param p1 153 12
note 12 A3 2 110
param p1 204 16
note 16 A3 2 110
param p1 255 20
note 20 A3 2 110
param p1 25 24
note 24 A3 2 110
param p1 76 28
note 28 A3 2 110
param p1 127 32
note 32 A3 2 110
param p1 178 36
note 36 A3 2 110
param p1 229 40
note 40 A3 2 110
expect sound 0 44
expect idle 80
expect peak_below -3
